  dialogueText:
  - "Look what we have here\u2026 I suppose you can take this relic, I have no use
    for it anymore..."
  - You will find crystals aggloremations... they call it liminals... use them to
    travel between realms...
  - IF you get to Dratorsa, be careful with his spheres... parry or attack them to
    destroy his barrier... that's when you strike...
